Norwegian traffic sign graphics and metadata in this repository are derived from
open data published by Statens vegvesen and Kartverket (Geonorge / NVDB).

Unless otherwise noted, that source material is available under the
Norwegian Licence for Open Government Data (NLOD) 2.0:
https://data.norge.no/nlod/en/2.0

Attribution example:
"Contains data under the Norwegian Licence for Open Government Data (NLOD)
made available by Statens vegvesen / Kartverket."

The conversion pipeline source code in tool/ is provided for open reuse
together with this catalogue. Retain the attribution above when
redistributing the sign graphics or the derived database.
